<title>USA: Capital Re increases qtly div to $0.07/shr.</title>
<headline>Capital Re increases qtly div to $0.07/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Re Corp on Thursday said it will increase its quarterly dividend to $0.07 per share of common stock from $0.06.</p>
<p>The fourth quarter 1996 dividend will be paid on Dec. 27, 1996 to holders of record on Dec. 20, 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
